 Morgue e decide di coinvolgerlo nelle indagini. Lo scrittore diviene così suo malgrado l'unica persona in grado di interpretare gli indizi lasciati sul luogo dall'estimatore assassino."},{"id":740731,"translatable_type":"title","translatable_id":47678,"locale":"it","key":"slug","value":"the-raven"}],"keywords":[{"id":368,"name":"serial killer","created_at":"2023-05-18T11:50:25.000000Z","updated_at":"2023-05-18T11:50:25.000000Z","pivot":{"title_id":47678,"keyword_id":368}},{"id":1709,"name":"poison","created_at":"2023-05-18T11:57:10.000000Z","updated_at":"2023-05-18T11:57:10.000000Z","pivot":{"title_id":47678,"keyword_id":1709}},{"id":3212,"name":"historical figure","created_at":"2023-05-18T12:05:44.000000Z","updated_at":"2023-05-18T12:05:44.000000Z","pivot":{"title_id":47678,"keyword_id":3212}},{"id":3341,"name":"blackmail","created_at":"2023-05-18T12:07:06.000000Z","updated_at":"2023-05-18T12:07:06.000000Z","pivot":{"title_id":47678,"keyword_id":3341}},{"id":4902,"name":"masked ball","created_at":"2023-05-18T12:26:17.000000Z","updated_at":"2023-05-18T12:26:17.000000Z","pivot":{"title_id":47678,"keyword_id":4902}},{"id":9499,"name":"baltimore, usa","created_at":"2023-11-13T08:01:03.000000Z","updated_at":"2023-11-13T08:01:03.000000Z","pivot":{"title_id":47678,"keyword_id":9499}},{"id":12737,"name":"newspaper office","created_at":"2024-10-16T07:53:03.000000Z","updated_at":"2024-10-16T07:53:03.000000Z","pivot":{"title_id":47678,"keyword_id":12737}},{"id":15677,"name":"buried alive","created_at":"2025-09-16T23:08:43.000000Z","updated_at":"2025-09-16T23:08:43.000000Z","pivot":{"title_id":47678,"keyword_id":15677}},{"id":17312,"name":"deadline","created_at":"2025-09-25T11:26:20.000000Z","updated_at":"2025-09-25T11:26:20.000000Z","pivot":{"title_id":47678,"keyword_id":17312}},{"id":23624,"name":"newspaper review","created_at":"2025-12-18T03:31:24.000000Z","updated_at":"2025-12-18T03:31:24.000000Z","pivot":{"title_id":47678,"keyword_id":23624}},{"id":23625,"name":"hard tim